WEBVTT

00:09:59.246 --> 00:10:06.079
the greatest motivator. And it also it
forces you as a storyteller to know what

00:10:06.079 --> 00:10:07.287
a character's desperate for

00:10:07.287 --> 00:10:12.246
and therefore what you are either afraid
of or hopeful for and ideally both

00:10:12.871 --> 00:10:17.329
the idea of desperation as a motivator.
I think that's incredibly powerful.

00:10:17.329 --> 00:10:21.329
And it's something that that not only
strikes me as relevant to, you know,

00:10:21.329 --> 00:10:22.996
to thinking about characters in a story,

00:10:23.329 --> 00:10:27.329
but also to understanding the people that
I work with and the people that I love.

00:10:28.412 --> 00:10:31.329
And I'm wondering is, is that
a lens that you apply?